{"modelVersion":"5.0.0","name":"@unicodex/ucx","version":"0.4.0","description":"Unicodex UCX 小说容器格式的纯 ArkTS 只读 SDK：解析 + 完整性校验 + 双层 Ed25519 验签 + UCXE 解密（AES-GCM/CBC、ChaCha20-Poly1305、Argon2id/PBKDF2）。无原生依赖。","main":"src/main/ets/ucx/Index.ets","types":"src/main/ets/ucx/Index.ets","author":"Unicodex Team","license":"MIT OR Apache-2.0","keywords":["unicodex","ucx","ebook","novel","ed25519","blake3","argon2id","aes-gcm","chacha20-poly1305","harmonyos","arkts"],"dependencies":{}}